{"id":"666578","name":"驴打滚","author":"芊芊美食记WQ","authorId":"10676629","desc":"","cover":"images/666578/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"水磨糯米粉","amount":"300克"},{"name":"糖","amount":"30克"},{"name":"凉水","amount":"300克"}],"sub":[{"name":"黄豆粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆沙","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"水磨糯米粉加入糖。","img":"images/666578/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入水。","img":"images/666578/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/666578/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"盘中刷薄油。","img":"images/666578/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入糯米糊。","img":"images/666578/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入蒸锅中，大火蒸20分钟。","img":"images/666578/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取出。","img":"images/666578/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"揉匀。","img":"images/666578/step_8.png"},{"step":9,"desc":"不断拉扯至有薄膜。","img":"images/666578/step_9.png"},{"step":10,"desc":"撒上黄豆粉。","img":"images/666578/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入糯米团。","img":"images/666578/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"擀薄。","img":"images/666578/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"红豆沙用一点凉白开调匀。","img":"images/666578/step_13.png"},{"step":14,"desc":"抹匀。","img":"images/666578/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"卷起来。","img":"images/666578/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"再撒上黄豆粉。","img":"images/666578/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"用线断成小段。","img":"images/666578/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"好了，软糯香甜，超级好吃。","img":"images/666578/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}